        "title": "Course-tencent-cloud before 2.0.2 IDOR via /api/refund/confirm",
        "descriptions": [
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "value": "Course-tencent-cloud before 2.0.2 contains an insecure direct object reference vulnerability that allows unauthenticated attackers to view other users' refund previews by supplying an order sn to /api/refund/confirm. Attackers can compute valid sn values from Sqids-encoded sequential order ids using the default key to disclose ordered items, prices, refund amounts, fees and deadlines."
          }
        ],
        "problemTypes": [
          {
